Major cleanup to consolidate to single frontend/ dashboard:

Moved to archive/:
- archive/original-viz/ - Standalone JSONL visualizer
  * Root-level React app (src/, index.html, package.json)
  * Client-side only, upload JSONL files
  * Replaced by frontend/ with live polling

- archive/express-server/ - Old TypeScript server
  * Express + TypeScript implementation (server/)
  * API endpoints and tests
  * Replaced by FastAPI (main.py + beads.py)

Current structure:
✅ main.py + beads.py - FastAPI backend
✅ frontend/ - React dashboard with live polling
✅ Dockerfile - Builds from frontend/ correctly
✅ README.md - Updated with clean structure diagram

Benefits:
- Single source of truth for UI (frontend/)
- No duplication of React Flow code
- Clearer project structure
- Archived code still accessible for reference

See archive/README.md for details on deprecated code.
