@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@
+# Archive
+
+This directory contains deprecated/historical code from PadAI development.
+
+## Contents
+
+### original-viz/
+
+**What:** Original standalone Beads JSONL visualizer
+
+**Status:** DEPRECATED - Replaced by `frontend/` dashboard
+
+**Description:**
+- Client-side React Flow visualization
+- Upload `.beads/issues.jsonl` files
+- View dependency graphs offline
+- No backend required
+
+**Why Archived:**
+- Functionality now in `frontend/` with live API polling
+- Duplicated React Flow + Dagre code
+- Cleaner to have single dashboard
+
+**Can Still Run:**
+```bash
+cd archive/original-viz
+npm install
+npm run dev
+# Visit http://localhost:5173
+```
+
+### express-server/
+
+**What:** Initial Express/TypeScript backend implementation
+
+**Status:** DEPRECATED - Replaced by FastAPI version
+
+**Description:**
+- Express + TypeScript server
+- bd CLI wrapper (TypeScript)
+- API endpoints for task coordination
+- Used for padai-2 through padai-8 tasks
+
+**Why Archived:**
+- Rewritten in Python (FastAPI) for better alignment with beads-mcp
+- FastAPI provides better async support and auto-generated docs
+- Python easier to integrate with beads-mcp tools in Phase 2
+
+**Can Still Run:**
+```bash
+cd archive/express-server
+npm install
+npm run dev
+# Visit http://localhost:3000
+```
+
+**Test Suite Still Useful:**
+- Jest tests for bd CLI integration
+- Integration tests for API endpoints
+- Reference for testing patterns
+
+## Migration Timeline
+
+1. **Nov 15, 2025 (Early)** - Created original React viz + Express server
+2. **Nov 15, 2025 (Mid)** - Switched to FastAPI backend
+3. **Nov 15, 2025 (Late)** - Created new `frontend/` dashboard
+4. **Nov 15, 2025 (Cleanup)** - Archived old code for clean structure
+
+## If You Want to Restore
+
+To restore the original viz as a standalone tool:
+
+```bash
+# Copy from archive
+cp -r archive/original-viz/* .
+
+# Run it
+npm install
+npm run dev
+```
+
+To compare Express vs FastAPI implementations:
+
+```bash
+# See Express version
+cat archive/express-server/src/index.ts
+
+# See FastAPI version
+cat main.py
+```
+
+## Future
+
+These may be deleted entirely in a future cleanup if confirmed unnecessary.
